---
permalink: /admin/health/
title: "Health | Admin"
bodyScripts:
  - src: "/scripts/admin-health.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/contact-widget.js"
    type: "module"
  - src: "/scripts/palette.js"
    type: "module"
---
<section class="app-page">

  {% include "chrome/admin-sections.njk" %}

  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-2">Health</h1>
  <p class="text-brand-muted mb-8 max-w-prose">
    What is running now, and how the last few deploys of each pipeline went.
  </p>

  <div id="status" role="status" aria-live="polite" class="mb-6 text-sm"></div>

  {# --- live -------------------------------------------------------------
     The same two checks the overview makes, because "is it up right now" is the first question
     and deploy history does not answer it. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-1">Right now</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4">Checked when this page loaded.</p>

  <ul class="grid gap-4 sm:grid-cols-2 mb-10">
    <li class="card">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-brand-text">API</h3>
        <span id="apiState" class="status-pill status-pill--unknown">Checking…</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">api.tzortzoglou.eu</p>
      <p id="apiDetail" class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-muted">&nbsp;</p>
    </li>
    <li class="card">
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3">
        <h3 class="font-semibold text-brand-text">App</h3>
        <span id="appState" class="status-pill status-pill--unknown">Checking…</span>
      </div>
      <p class="hint">app.tzortzoglou.eu</p>
      <p id="appDetail" class="mt-3 text-sm text-brand-muted">&nbsp;</p>
    </li>
  </ul>

  {# --- restarts ---------------------------------------------------------
     The one thing deploy history cannot answer. A deploy that succeeded and a container that has
     restarted eleven times since look identical in GitHub Actions. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-1">API restarts</h2>
  <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4 max-w-prose">
    Every time the API process started. A deploy shows here as one restart; several in a row
    without a deploy means something is falling over.
  </p>
  <div id="boots" class="card mb-10">
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted">Loading…</p>
  </div>

  {# --- deploys ----------------------------------------------------------
     Rendered by admin-health.js: one block per workflow, newest first. A failed run names the
     step that failed, because that is the one thing worth knowing before opening the log. #}
  <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-brand-text mb-1">Deploys</h2>
  <p id="deployAge" class="text-sm text-brand-muted mb-4"></p>
  <div id="deploys">
    <p class="text-sm text-brand-muted">Loading…</p>
  </div>

</section>
